summary:
  The first entry of the panel icon's right-click menu sends Stop instead
  of the big button's own press.

history:
  The entry shows the big button's face, Play, Pause or Stop, and must do
  what that face promises: over an episode it reads Pause and has to keep
  the place, over a silent widget it reads Play and has to start. One road
  for every face, transport("PlayPause"), is what makes the two agree; an
  entry with its own idea of the press would stop an episode it offered to
  pause and do nothing where it offered to play.

target:
  package/contents/ui/PanelAction.qml

find:
              app.transport("PlayPause");

replace:
              app.transport("Stop");

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_panelaction.qml::test_the_first_entry_says_and_does_what_the_big_button_does.
  Line-neutral.
